spans.s:
सं-√ वच् P. -वक्ति (in the nonconj. tenses also Ā.), to proclaim, announce, publish, communicate, Pañcar.;
to speak or tell or say to (acc. with or without प्रति), MBh.; Pañcat.; Kathās.;
 (Ā.), to converse, talk with, RV.

सं-√ वद् P. Ā. -वदति, ˚ते (ind.p. सम्-उद्य, q.v.), (Ā.) to speak together or at the same time, AitBr.; ChUp.;
 (P.; Ā. only mc.)
to converse with (instr.) or about (loc.), RV.; AV.; TS.; Br.;
 (P.) to sound together or in concord (said of musical instruments), AV., to agree, accord, consent, Hariv.; Mṛcch.; Kathās.;
to coincide, fit together (so as to give one sense), Ratnāv.;
to speak, speak to, address (acc.), BhP.;
to designate, call, name (two acc.), Śrutab. :
Caus. -वादयति, ˚ते (ind.p. -वाद्य, q.v.), to cause to converse with (instr.) or about (loc.), ŚBr.; ŚāṅkhŚr.;
to invite or call upon to speak, Hit., (v.l.);
to cause to sound, play (a musical instrument), MBh.; Kathās.

सं-√ 5. वस् P. Ā. -वसति, ˚ते, (inf. -वस्तुम्; pr. p. -वसत्, or -व॑सान [q.v.]),
to dwell together, live or associate with (instr. with and without सह, or acc.), RV. &c. &c.;
to cohabit with (acc.), W.;
to meet or assemble together, R.;
to stay, abide, dwell in (loc.), MBh.; R.;
to spend, pass (time), R.; BhP. :
Caus. -वासयति, to cause to live together, bring together with (instr. with or without सह), RV.; TBr.; Lāṭy.;
to provide with a lodging or dwelling, MBh.

सं-√ वह् (cf. सम्- √ 1. ऊह्) cl. 1. P. Ā. -वहति, ˚ते (inf. -वोढुम्), to bear or carry together or along or away, take, convey, bring, AV. &c.;
to load (a cart or car), R.;
to take a wife, marry, MW.;
to carry or move or rub (the hand) along the body, stroke, soothe, MBh. (3. du. pf. सं-ववाहतुः, iii, 11005 accord. to some fr. सं-√ वाह्);
to manifest, express, BhP. :
Pass. -समुह्यते, to be borne by (instr.), ride on (instr.), MBh.; BhP. :
Caus. -वाहयति, ˚ते (Pass. -वाह्यते), to cause to be brought together, bring together, assemble, Hariv.; Rājat.;
to guide, conduct, drive (a carriage), MBh.; R.; Kathās.;
to chase, hunt, Pañcat. v, 14;
to rub, stroke, Āpast.; R.; Śak. &c.;
to set in motion, Kād.;
to take (a wife), marry, Vet. (v.l.)

सं-√ विज् Ā. -विजते, to tremble or start with fear, start up, run away, AV.; VS.;
to fall to pieces, burst asunder, ĀpŚr. :
Caus. -वेजयति, to frighten, terrify, RV.

सं-वि-√ ज्ञा P. Ā. -जानाति, -जानीते, to agree with, recommend, advise (with gen. of pers.), MBh.;
to understand, BrahmUp. :
Caus. -ज्नापयति or -ज्नपयति (aor. -अजिज्ञपत्), to make known, proclaim, recite, repeat, Rājat.

सं-√ 1. विद् cl. 2. P. Ā. -वेत्ति, -वित्ते, (3. pl. -विदते, or -विद्रते, Pāṇ. vii, 1, 7), to know together, know thoroughly, know, recognize, RV. &c. &c.;
to perceive, feel, taste, Suśr.;
to come to an understanding, agree with, approve (acc.), MBh.; R. :
Caus. -वेदयति, to cause to know or perceive, PraśnUp. ;
to make known, declare, MBh.;
to know, perceive, Bhaṭṭ. :
Caus. See सं-वेदित.

सं-वि-√ धा P. Ā. -दधाति, -धत्ते, to dispose, arrange, settle, fix, determine, prescribe, MBh.; R.; Suśr.;
to direct, order, Hariv.;
to carry on, conduct, manage, attend to, mind, Mn.; MBh. &c.;
to use, employ, R.;
to make use of, act or proceed with (instr.), Pañcat.;
 (with मानसम्) to keep the mind fixed or composed, be in good spirits, Bhartṛ.;
to make, render (two acc.), Naiṣ.;
to set, put, lay, place, MBh. :
Pass. -धीयते, to be disposed or arranged &c., MBh. :
Caus. -धापयति, to cause to dispose or manage, Kād.

सं-वि-√ भज् P. Ā. -भजति, ˚ते, to divide, separate, Suśr.;
 give a share or portion to, distribute, apportion, share with (instr. with and without सह dat., or gen.), MBh.; Kāv. &c.;
to furnish or provide or present with (instr.), ib. :
Caus. See ˚विभाज्य below.

सं-√ विश् P. विशति, (ep. also Ā. ˚ते), to approach near to, associate or attach one's self to (acc. or instr.), RV.; VS.;
to enter together, enter into (acc., rarely loc.), Kauś.; MBh. &c.;
to merge one's self into (acc.), MBh.;
to lie down, rest, repose in or upon (loc. or उपरि ifc.), sleep with (instr. with and without सह, or dat.), ŚBr. &c. &c.;
to cohabit, have sexual intercourse with (acc.), Mn.; Yājñ.; MārkP.;
to sit down with (acc.), Hariv.;
to engage in, have to do with (acc.), BhP. :
Caus. -वेशयति, to cause to lie together or down or on Yājñ., Sch.;
to place or lay together or on, bring to (loc.), Kauś.; MBh. &c.

1. सं-√ वृ P. Ā. -वृणोति, -वृणुते &c. (inf. -वरीतुम् or -वरितुम्, ep. also -वर्तुम्), to cover up, enclose, hide, conceal, MBh.; Kāv. &c.;
to shut, close (a door), MBh.;
to put together or in order, arrange, Kathās.;
to gather up (snares), Hit. (v.l.);
to ward off, keep back, restrain, check, stop, Bhaṭṭ.; Kathās.;
 (Ā. -वरते) to gather (intr.), accumulate, augment, increase, RV. i, 121, 5 :
Caus. -वारयति (ind.p. वार्य), to ward off keep or drive back, repel, MBh.; Hariv.;
 Desid. See सं-वुवूर्षु, col. 2.

2. सं-√ वृत् Ā. -वर्तते (pf. p. -ववृत्व॑स्, q.v.; Ved. inf. -वृ॑तस्; ind. -वर्तम्),
to turn or go towards, approach near to, arrive at, RV.; AV.; R.;
to go against, attack (acc.), MBh.;
to meet, encounter (as foes), RV. iv, 24, 4;
to come together, be rolled together, be conglomerated, PañcavBr.; Kauś.;
 (also with मिथस्) to have sexual intercourse together, ŚBr.; Āpast.;
to take shape, come into being, be produced, arise from (abl.), RV. &c. &c.;
to come round or about, come to pass, happen, occur, take place, be fulfilled (as time), MBh.; Kāv.;
 &c.;
to begin, commence, R.;
to be, exist, ChUp.; MBh. &c.;
to become, grow, get (with nom.), R.; Ragh.;
to be conducive to, serve for (dat.), Lalit. :
Caus. वर्तयति, to cause to turn or revolve, roll (lit. and fig.), RV. &c. &c.;
to turn towards or hither, RV.;
to clench (the fist), Hariv.;
to wrap up, envelop, MBh.;
to crumple up, crush, destroy, MBh.; R.;
to bring about, accomplish, perform, execute, Hariv.; R.; BhP.;
to fulfil, satisfy (a wish), R.;
to think of, find out (a remedy), Car. :
Desid. -वि॑वृत्सति, to wish to have sexual intercourse with (acc.), AV.

सं-√ वृध् Ā. -वर्धते (rarely P.), to grow to perfection or completion, grow up, increase, RV. &c. &c.;
to fulfil, satisfy, grant, R. :
Caus. -वर्धयति, to cause to grow, rear, bring up, foster, cherish, augment, enlarge, strengthen, beautify, make prosperous or happy, MBh.; Kāv. &c.;
to present with (instr.), R.; Ragh.;
to fulfil, grant (a wish), Mn.; R. :
Desid. of Caus. See सं-विवर्धयिषु below.

सं-√ वेष्ट् Ā. -वेष्टते, to be rolled up, shrink together, MBh. vi, 4069 (B. समचेष्टन्त) :
Caus. -वेष्टयति, to envelop, clasp, surround, wrap up, cover, MBh.; R. &c.;
to wind round, KātyŚr.;
to roll up, Śaṃk.;
to cause to shrink together, MBh.

सं-√ व्ये P. Ā. -व्ययति, ˚ते (pf. p. -विव्यान, q.v.), to roll or cover up, RV.; Bhaṭṭ.;
to put on, wrap one's self in (acc.), RV.; BhP.;
to supply or furnish or provide or equip with, RV.; AV.; PārGṛ. :
Caus. See ˚वायित.
